    "detailed_description": "<strong>Monster Path</strong> is a <strong>JRPG roguelike adventure</strong> with <strong>turn based battles</strong> and <strong>monster collecting </strong>elements. Build a powerful party of monsters, each with unique stacking abilities, and engage in strategic turn-based battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Balance risk and reward as you choose your path, decide which enemies to fight, and which power ups to stack<br></li><li> Complete quests as you move through the biomes to change the future monsters and game ending<br></li><li> 35+ Monsters to befriend, each with unique power ups<br></li><li> 9 biomes, 8 unique companions, and 100+ moves to compliment your build and play style</li></ul>",
